      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "QUOTING TOOLS  ->  starter helper\n- search_quote_history_tool(terms)\n     -> search_quote_history\n        (one term per call: terms are AND-ed)\n- calculate_quote(items, qtys)\n     pure Python: paper_supplies\n     unit_price x qty, bulk-discount tier,\n     rounding (no LLM arithmetic)",
      "originalText": "QUOTING TOOLS  ->  starter helper\n- search_quote_history_tool(terms)\n     -> search_quote_history\n        (one term per call: terms are AND-ed)\n- calculate_quote(items, qtys)\n     pure Python: paper_supplies\n     unit_price x qty, bulk-discount tier,\n     rounding (no LLM arithmetic)",
      "fontSize": 14,
