    {
      "id": "el9pdccp5u1n1l",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1772,
      "y": 162,
      "width": 436,
      "height": 487.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1857355769,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 376927472,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "DECISION RULES (enforced in code)\n\n1. Item names mapped to the exact catalog;\n   unsupported items (e.g. balloons) are\n   excluded and explained to the customer.\n\n2. Stock < requested qty -> reorder only if\n   cash >= cost AND supplier ETA <= deadline;\n   otherwise partial fulfilment / decline.\n\n3. Stock below min_stock_level after a sale\n   -> automatic replenishment order.\n\n4. Quote = unit price x qty, tiered bulk\n   discount by order size, sanity-checked\n   against similar historical quotes.\n\n5. A sale is recorded only for items that\n   can be delivered by the deadline.\n\n6. Tools use the request date, never today;\n   transactions are written as 'YYYY-MM-DD'\n   (a time suffix hides same-day rows).\n\n7. Large orders: financial report checked\n   before committing the sale.",
      "originalText": "DECISION RULES (enforced in code)\n\n1. Item names mapped to the exact catalog;\n   unsupported items (e.g. balloons) are\n   excluded and explained to the customer.\n\n2. Stock < requested qty -> reorder only if\n   cash >= cost AND supplier ETA <= deadline;\n   otherwise partial fulfilment / decline.\n\n3. Stock below min_stock_level after a sale\n   -> automatic replenishment order.\n\n4. Quote = unit price x qty, tiered bulk\n   discount by order size, sanity-checked\n   against similar historical quotes.\n\n5. A sale is recorded only for items that\n   can be delivered by the deadline.\n\n6. Tools use the request date, never today;\n   transactions are written as 'YYYY-MM-DD'\n   (a time suffix hides same-day rows).\n\n7. Large orders: financial report checked\n   before committing the sale.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "elgqzlecfgxsql",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "baseline": 483
    },
